      "text": {
        "en": "Clients describe mixed impressions of the clinic team. While several pet owners praise veterinarians and reception staff like Mary for gentle bedside care and clear guidance, other reviewers complain about indifferent service, rushed interactions, and dismissive attitudes during checkout."
      }
    },
