      "title": {
        "en": "Concerns over wellness plans and costs"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers raise substantial concerns regarding treatment costs and wellness plan coverage. Although two clients found fees reasonable, multiple pet owners report feeling misled by unexpected add-on charges, high procedure estimates, and limited benefits included under monthly subscriptions."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "communication",
      "sentiment": "negative",
      "mentions": 5,
      "title": {
        "en": "Scheduling difficulties and phone delays"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners report noticeable communication hurdles when attempting to book appointments or request test results. Clients highlight unanswered phone lines, unreturned voice messages, and discrepancies between the online booking schedule and in-clinic availability."
      }
    }
  ],
